│    19     raises httpx.HTTPStatusError instead, a different, unrelated exception type.                                                                      │
│    20     This class gives callers something equivalent to catch (it subclasses OSError,                                                                    │
│    21     the same base requests.exceptions.HTTPError ultimately derives from) without                                                                      │
│    22     this module depending on the requests package to define it.                                                                                       │
│    23     """                                                                                                                                               │
│    24                                                                                                                                                       │
