│    36     preserves an equivalent, catchable failure without importing requests.                                                                            │
│    37     """                                                                                                                                               │
│    38                                                                                                                                                       │
│    39                                                                                                                                                       │
│    40 class ScadaTimeout(OSError):                                                                                                                          │
│    41     """First-party stand-in for requests.exceptions.Timeout.                                                                                          │
│    42                                                                                                                                                       │
